=2 Walkthrough
+ Head to (H-7, center next to big tree) in {z:East Ronfaure (S)}. Click on the ??? you find there to spawn a {m:Goblin Picaroon}.
+ After killing the NM, check the ??? again to complete the quest. Make sure to examine the ???s or you will fail when you return.

=2 Notes
* The {m:Goblin Picaroon} NM is a Goblin THF with 8-10k HP. He occasionally triple-attacks, but neither hits very hard nor evades all that much.
* After being killed, the NM can be spawned again after approximately 15 earth minutes.
* Accuracy, Attack, Defense, Evasion increases when under 20%.
* Does not have to be soloed.
* Other members of your party can get the experience points reward even when it's not their current Campaign OP.
* Only needed to be killed once for other members who also have this OP .
* Killable by: __(see {p:testimonials|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Talk:Delta_Strike_I_(San_d'Oria)})__

